TITLE Mix DIC and Ca solutions, heat to 200 C with calcite precip/dissolve
SOLUTION 1
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    C(4) 50 mmol/kgw
SOLUTION 2
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 50 mmol/kgw
MIX 1
    1 1
    2 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 10
REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 40 60 80 100 120 140 160 180 200
END
